Source: paperweight-grub
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), grub-common
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/jalexlong/paperweight-os
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: paperweight-grub
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: grub-pc | grub-efi-amd64 | grub-efi-arm64
Description: PaperweightOS GRUB theme — all four Catppuccin variants
 Installs a Catppuccin-themed GRUB2 boot menu for PaperweightOS.
 Ships all four Catppuccin variants (Macchiato, Latte, Frappé, Mocha).
 Sets GRUB_THEME in /etc/default/grub and runs update-grub on install.
 .
 Switch variants with: sudo paperweight-grub-theme <macchiato|latte|frappe|mocha>
 .
 Recommends grub-pc or grub-efi; no-op if /etc/default/grub is absent.
